{
  "_doc": "Regression evidence plan for PR #542 (EPAC-1985: reduce ContentView deep-link complexity). See docs/architecture/deep-link-routes.md for the route catalog. The 18 openURL steps below cover every route in that catalog. The regression assertion is: for every route ID, the before-revision and after-revision screenshots are pixel-identical (modulo dynamic content masked by EPAC_EVIDENCE_MODE).",
